Z||000002||chrissherman||04-22-2001||09:35 PM||||Is it a T handle or a loup????The T handle is over the manafold and the loup is on the left side of the moter.Witch is the calibrated ONE???? <P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://homepages.about.com/fierowhite/sitebuildercontent/sitebuilderpictures/white5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||FieroJoe||04-22-2001||09:40 PM||||84-86 2.5L engines had the dipstick on the right side of the engine.<P>87-88 DIS 2.5L engines had it on the left side.  My 87 4cyl has a T-Handle dipstick.<P>If you are looking to see if the recall has been done to your car, look on the inside side of your gas filler door.  If below your unleaded fuel sticker there is a sticker that says "Check and change engine oil frequently", the recall has been done.<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Fiero87311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto near completion!<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
